      "summary": {
        "en": "Turns the trunk to the opposite side; braces the waist.",
        "zh": "让躯干转向对侧，并帮助稳住腰腹。"
      },
      "detail": {
        "en": "The superficial side-wall sheet starts on ribs five through twelve and reaches the iliac crest, pubic region and linea alba through an aponeurosis. With the pelvis fixed, left external oblique turns the chest right [M92].\n\nIt also resists unwanted bending and twisting during the exercise tasks. The shared card retains the exercise links already published by the back topic.",
        "zh": "浅层侧腹肌片起于第 5–12 肋，止于髂嵴，并经腱膜连到耻骨区和白线。骨盆固定时，左腹外斜肌把胸口转向右侧 [M92]。\n\n它在训练任务中也抵抗多余的弯曲和旋转。共享卡保留背部主题已录入的动作链接。"
      }
    },
